---
// 项目介绍主体：克制几句话 + 杂志感艺术排印（流体巨字、首字下沉、sticky 章节号、中英并置）
---
<section class="intro" id="intro">
  <div class="intro__grid">
    <aside class="intro__side" data-reveal-stagger>
      <p class="intro__num">01<span>／04</span></p>
      <p class="intro__label">Project</p>
      <p class="intro__meta">开源 · openwhu 社区共建</p>
      <hr class="rule intro__rule" />
    </aside>

    <div class="intro__body">
      <p class="intro__quote" data-reveal="clip">
        <span class="display intro__en">A campus, quietly woven.</span>
      </p>

      <h2 class="intro__cn dropcap" data-reveal-stagger>
        <span>珞珈山下的孩子，做了一件小事。</span>
        <span>Luotopia 把课表、教室、图书馆、课程评价与</span>
        <span>珞珈防空洞这些散落的校园日常，拢进同一个从容的界面。</span>
        <span>不为热闹——只为让珞珈的清晨与深夜里，少些卡顿，多些从容。</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="intro__note" data-reveal="fade">
        Open source · 由 openwhu 社区与武大学生共同构建。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro { padding: var(--section-y) clamp(1.25rem,8vw,7rem); position: relative; }
  .intro__grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 8fr 1fr; gap: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    max-width: var(--wide); margin-inline: auto; align-items: start;
  }
  /* 左侧 sticky 章节号 */
  .intro__side {
    position: sticky; top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .7rem;
    align-self: start;
  }
  .intro__num { font-family: var(--ff-display); font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(2.4rem,5vw,4rem); color: var(--accent); line-height: .9; }
  .intro__num span { color: var(--fg-3); font-size: .42em; }
  .intro__label { font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .36em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-2); }
  .intro__meta { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--fg-3); line-height: 1.6; }
  .intro__rule { margin-top: .5rem; width: 4rem; }

  .intro__body { grid-column: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem); }
  .intro__en { display: block; color: var(--fg-2); font-size: clamp(1.3rem,3vw,2.2rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.01em; overflow: hidden; }

  .intro__cn {
    font-family: var(--ff-serif-cn); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4.6vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.34; letter-spacing: .04em;
    color: var(--fg);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .1em;
  }
  .intro__cn span { display: block; }

  .intro__note { color: var(--fg-3); font-size: .85rem; letter-spacing: .04em; padding-top: 1.4rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .intro__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .intro__side { position: static; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem; }
    .intro__rule { display: none; }
    .intro__body { grid-column: 1; }
  }
</style>
